{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>And they embalmed him and put him in a coffin.</b> In the same coffin in which the embalming had been done they placed his bones, and they did not bury him in the ground. Through this the coffin became known to generations, as it says: וַיִּקַּח מֹשֶׁה אֶת עַצְמוֹת יוֹסֵף (Exodus 13:19). [End of the section Va-yehi. End of the book of Genesis, with the help of the One who makes all, in six days.]"], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 50, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:35:38.621848457Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}